  "transformations": [
    "One-cell scalar specialization of complete selected startup CNEVECI/CLSKEW3 IREP0/CDERII arithmetic; other IREP branches are unsupported, not approximated.",
    "Unused X21 startup dead stores omitted; array loops reduce to one cell and raw fixed-size POD records.",
    "Selected centered uniform CINMAS mass and native total-inertia expression retained; physical and area-added partitions remain separate diagnostics.",
    "Binary64 sqrt, division and left-associated operations preserved; no rsqrt, fast math or fused multiply-add enabled for qualification.",
    "Added finite/material/convexity/determinant-boundary checks and staged output; this is explicitly narrower than general native input acceptance.",
    "Generic Vec3/Matrix3 records extracted with compatibility aliases; no Reissner chart or frame arithmetic moved."
  ],
